    "q": "Analyze the statement and implicit assumptions:\n\nStatement: 'The state government has banned the sale of single-use plastics to curtail environmental pollution.'\n\nAssumption I: Single-use plastics are a notable contributor to environmental degradation.\nAssumption II: The ban can be effectively enforced by municipal authorities.\n\nWhich assumptions are implicit in the statement?",
